    title: "平行四边形，文字环绕效果",
    html: "<div class=\"main\">\n  <div class=\"shape-left\"></div>\n  <div class=\"shape-right\"></div>\n  <p>\n    Eirmod clita lorem eos vulputate dolore illum dolor voluptua kasd at sanctus sadipscing lorem kasd nibh. Et\n    dolores\n    sea vulputate sed et. Sanctus diam clita duo gubergren in vel labore sanctus et sit eirmod congue lobortis.\n    Invidunt\n    diam eos aliquyam at dolore justo. In aliquyam labore gubergren. Lorem sadipscing eu gubergren dolor eu invidunt\n    ipsum invidunt labore. Tempor et diam labore. Eu et magna magna elitr magna augue veniam tation nulla invidunt\n    invidunt exerci facer eirmod voluptua feugiat labore aliquyam. Sed at tempor magna justo nostrud sit eos magna\n    dolor\n    zzril sed invidunt gubergren accumsan dolor ipsum facilisis consetetur.\n  </p>\n</div>",
    css: "* {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nhtml,\nbody {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  display: flex;\n  background-color: #272822;\n}\n\n.main {\n  width: 50%;\n  height: 50%;\n  margin: auto;\n  word-break: break-all;\n  clip-path: polygon(30% 0%, 0 100%, 70% 100%, 100% 0);\n}\n\n.shape-left {\n  float: left;\n  width: 30%;\n  height: 100%;\n  shape-outside: polygon(0 0, 0 100%, 100% 0%);\n}\n\n.shape-right {\n  float: right;\n  width: 30%;\n  height: 100%;\n  shape-outside: polygon(0 100%, 100% 0%, 100% 100%);\n}\n\np {\n  background-color: rgb(42, 72, 180);\n}",
